("ul", ["**Tissue culture** grows new plants from a small piece of tissue in a nutrient medium; used for orchids, ornamental plants and seedless fruit.", "Advantages of vegetative propagation: plants raised produce flowers and fruits earlier, banana and seedless plants can be grown, and genetic features stay the same.", "Asexual reproduction needs one parent; offspring are identical (clones) with very little variation."]),
